## Title: Forge_APIRef
## Notes: In-game WoW API reference. Searchable lookup of function signatures, security flags, patch history, and examples. Per-namespace data ships in LoadOnDemand sibling addons (Forge_APIRef-<Namespace>) so the core stays small and only the namespaces you query pay memory. Adds an APIRef tab to /forge.
